            "content_paragraph_1": {
                "type": "textarea",
                "label": "Content Paragraph 1",
                "value": "Founded in the year 2005, Imperium Software Technologies FZCO is a subsidiary of a parent organization Protocol Systems and is dedicated to enabling better functionality of telephony.\r\n\r\nWe are an industry leader in CTI solutions and the only industry expert in the region to hold almost a decade of association with Avaya as a certified Avaya DevConnect Technology partner. Our expertise in complete ICT solutions endows us the status of a fully-charged software production house that develops value added products. We seamlessly integrate of varied business applications with a telephony system for smart workflow.\r\n\r\nWe enable complete business automation by providing advice, solution, implementation and applications all in one place. We are one-stop solution partner for all your ICT needs.\r\n\r\nThe Company moved from just implementing telephony systems to developing a brand of its own with applications built on top of a VoIP system to support additional features that allow better grip over business communication."
