                "label": "Main Description",
                "value": "Today's Customer service representative are multi-tasking, handling basic customer service inquires taking request\/complaints, booking appointments etc. As a result, demand is steadily growing for tools that enable agents to effectively multi-task.\n\nThe IMCC is a powerful desktop application integrates Avaya's real-time communications capabilities with leading Business Applications like Microsoft CRM\/Dynamics, JD-Edwards, and Salesforce to improve productivity & enhance customer services"
