                "type": "text",
                "label": "Features Title 2",
                "value": "Key Features & Benefits"
            },
            "features_2": {
                "type": "textarea",
                "label": "Features Content 2 (HTML allowed)",
                "value": "<ul>\n<li>Click to Dial from contact lists and customer records that contain phone numbers<\/li>\n<li>Automatic Call Logging of inbound and outbound calls stores call history within the client record, including call duration and missed calls.<\/li>\n<li>Call Annotation allows a user to enter personal notes during a call and stores the notes in the record along with call detail such as time and date.<\/li>\n<li>Call Duration automatically captures conversation time for inbound and outbound calls, rounds it to the nearest minute, and stores it in the customer record.<\/li>\n<\/ul>"
            }
